        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Word of Mouth, Walks Like Rihanna, Chasing the Sun, I Found You, We Own the Night, Show Me Love (America), Glow in the Dark\n- People: The Wanted\n- Places: Australia, United Kingdom, Ireland\n\nFacts:\n- The Wanted released six singles before the album Word of Mouth: Chasing the Sun, I Found You, Walks Like Rihanna, We Own the Night, Show Me Love (America), and Glow in the Dark.\n- Walks Like Rihanna is a song by the British-Irish boy band The Wanted.\n- Walks Like Rihanna was released in Australia on 10 May 2013.\n- Walks Like Rihanna was released in the United Kingdom and Ireland on 23 June 2013 as the third single from The Wanted's third studio album Word of Mouth.\n- Glow in the Dark was released two weeks before the album Word of Mouth.",
